WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
What needs reordering?

00:04.000 --> 00:06.000
Away from your desk? Just ask.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
Spark: Six items are below their reorder points at Tacoma Distribution Center, but each already has an open draft PO.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.000
Can you draft a PO for the Snow Shovel? It checks which one you mean, before creating anything.

00:16.000 --> 00:20.000
Spark: Which Snow Shovel should I draft? Let's do commercial. Proposal H6: 282 Snow Shovel 24 in, Commercial, from Pacific Winter Supply, est. $2,256.00.

00:20.000 --> 00:24.000
Reply yes. And the draft is created. Yes H6.

00:24.000 --> 00:32.000
Spark: Done. Created a draft purchase order for Pacific Winter Supply. Created, not yet issued.

00:32.000 --> 00:42.000
From a text to a draft purchase order. Spark Solo, from Spark Inventory.
